OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent review ordered into
OL,4,Asurgery carried out by NHS Grampian
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has ordered a
OL,7,Freview into hepatobiliary surgery at
OL,8,FNHS Grampian after a whistleblower
OL,9,Fleaked a document showing 19 avoidable
OL,10,Fdeaths at the health board.
OL,12,FDr Mohammed Habib claimed he had
OL,13,Fcontacted the Scottish government on
OL,14,Ffour separate occasions and had gone to
OL,15,Fthe police and the lord advocate with
OL,16,Fhis concerns about patient safety at
OL,17,Fthe board.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
